    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet within the tranquil and historic village of Enniskerry, Co. Wicklow, 1 Pinehurst is a rare opportunity to own a one-of-a-kind residence in a setting that blends natural beauty, architectural elegance, and exceptional connectivity.\n\nA Home of Distinction\n\n1 Pinehurst has been thoughtfully designed to offer a refined living experience, with a focus on space, light, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow. These are generously proportioned homes, ideal for modern family living, entertaining, and quiet retreat.\n\nKey Features:\n\n• Architecturally designed detached home with striking contemporary façades\n• Spacious open-plan living areas with large-format glazing to maximise natural light\n• Bespoke kitchen with premium cabinetry, stone worktops, and integrated appliances\n• Luxurious bathrooms and ensuites with high-spec sanitary ware and elegant tiling\n• Energy-efficient air-to-water heat pump system\n• High-performance insulation and airtightness for superior energy rating\n• Landscaped garden and private driveway\n• Wired for smart home technology and EV charging\n• Living room featuring soaring 16ft vaulted ceilings for an expansive, light-filled atmosphere\n• Underfloor heating on the ground floor and antique brass fittings throughout\n• Triple-glazed aluclad windows by NorDan for enhanced comfort and energy efficiency\n\nLayouts Designed for Living\n\nCarefully considered layout including:\n• A large entrance hallway with feature staircase\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area opening onto a private garden\n• A separate living room with feature vaulted ceilings\n• Separate lounge, study or bedroom for flexible use on the ground floor\n• Utility room and guest WC\n• Five spacious bedrooms, including a master suite with ensuite\n• Storage throughout\n\nThe Best of Both Worlds\n\nLocated just a short stroll from the heart of Enniskerry village, 1 Pinehurst offers a lifestyle that is both peaceful and connected. Enjoy artisan cafés, local boutiques, and the grandeur of Powerscourt Estate just minutes from your door.\nIncluding its idyllic setting, 1 Pinehurst is exceptionally well connected:\n\n• 5 minutes to the N11 and M50 for swift access to Dublin\n• 15 minutes to Bray DART station and Cherrywood Luas\n• 30 minutes to Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport"
      },
